#==============================================================================================
#
#   tree_builder_1 - Layout::TreeBuilder: insertion into the tree and pseudo-elements
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/TreeBuilder.cpp (lines 1-429) and TreeBuilder.h: the constructor
#       and the ancestor stack, the insertion parents that keep a block's in-flow children all
#       block-level or all inline-level (creating anonymous wrappers), the insertion of a node
#       into its nearest inline or block ancestor, the GeneratedContentImageProvider of
#       `content: url(...)` images, and the boxes of ::before, ::after, ::marker and ::backdrop.
